    "title": "Volleyball Recap: Gorham Fayette Comes Up Short - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n20 hours ago Gorham Fayette was not able to break out of their rough patch on Tuesday as the team picked up their 17th straight defeat. They came up short against the Edon Bombers, falling 3-0. Unfortunately, that's the second time they've come up short against the Bombers this season, as they also lost their prior matchup 3-0 on September 4th. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
